Nathan Gilbert wrote:

> What are some good uses for the looking glasses that nymphs always seem to
> drop? Normally I just leave them behind, but your comment seems to imply
> some worth for them. Please spoil me.

you can (a)pply it towards monsters if they can see you and themselves: 
non-humanoid non-unicorns (yes, including dragons, Ki-rin and some major 
demons) may become scared for 2-8 turns, Medusa stones herself, floating 
eyes paralyze themselves, umber hulks confuse themselves and nymphs 
steal the mirror and teleport away. The worst thing about mirrors is 
that, when you break one, your luck gets reduced by 2.

